WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.908 --> 00:00:16.795
My name is Maia, and I am a 47-year-old midwife living in Rome.

2
00:00:17.876 --> 00:00:21.618
Midwives are women who assist other women during childbirth.

3
00:00:22.738 --> 00:00:28.241
Midwifery is a profession that has been practiced since human families have been having children.

4
00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:33.144
My mother taught me how to be a midwife, and she taught me well.

5
00:00:34.444 --> 00:00:38.486
Giving birth is a joyous event, but it can be dangerous.

6
00:00:39.207 --> 00:00:45.810
So a midwife must, with the help of the gods, make sure the mother and her child are

7
00:00:45.890 --> 00:00:48.011
healthy and safe.

8
00:00:48.252 --> 00:00:56.436
In 146 BC Roman soldiers destroyed the Greek city of Corinth, made my mother a slave, and took

9
00:00:56.496 --> 00:00:57.176
her to Rome.

10
00:00:58.097 --> 00:01:03.820
Romans respect Greek science, and Greek midwives like my mother are well trained.

11
00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:10.927
When my mother settled in Rome in her master's house, he allowed her to work as a midwife

12
00:01:11.107 --> 00:01:12.127
for other families.

13
00:01:13.208 --> 00:01:17.029
She was paid well, so my mother was able to save some money.

14
00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:20.391
Soon she was able to buy her freedom.

15
00:01:22.032 --> 00:01:27.134
From age nine, I accompanied my mother to every birth and learned the craft.

16
00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:31.476
I discovered how women experience the birth of children.

17
00:01:32.568 --> 00:01:39.230
For example, it is natural for women to be fearful, especially when they are having their first child.

18
00:01:40.110 --> 00:01:45.491
Older mothers are more confident and understand that the pain eventually ends.

19
00:01:46.552 --> 00:01:51.593
But the first time I saw a birth, I became sick to my stomach.

20
00:01:52.753 --> 00:01:57.755
I had not expected such a large amount of blood, and the birth was very messy.

21
00:01:58.875 --> 00:02:02.296
The new mother cried so much that I cried too.

22
00:02:03.364 --> 00:02:09.106
My mother sternly told me that a good midwife must be calm in order to be a strong

23
00:02:09.146 --> 00:02:10.286
support for the mother.

24
00:02:11.006 --> 00:02:15.888
Even though there are some sad moments, being a midwife has many joys.

25
00:02:16.528 --> 00:02:19.269
So I am teaching my daughter Sofia this craft too.

26
00:02:20.629 --> 00:02:24.410
To be a good midwife, you should be able to read and write.

27
00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:33.294
When my mother was young, midwives learned mostly from experience, but now, midwives have some medical knowledge too.

28
00:02:34.294 --> 00:02:40.919
Hippocrates, the Greek physician, wrote a lot about women and their babies, and good midwives need to read

29
00:02:41.039 --> 00:02:47.083
and understand his ideas to deal with some of the problems that can arise during childbirth.

30
00:02:48.104 --> 00:02:56.349
Midwives also have to understand the nature of plants; for example, we need to know which herbs make

31
00:02:56.449 --> 00:02:58.371
labor and childbirth easier.

32
00:02:59.431 --> 00:03:05.636
One time a woman was in labor for over 12 hours, and the pain was almost unbearable.

33
00:03:06.357 --> 00:03:13.022
She became very tired and weak, so I made tea from the root of vervain, a plant with

34
00:03:13.102 --> 00:03:14.203
small purple flowers.

35
00:03:16.205 --> 00:03:21.689
When the mother drank this tea, it helped to speed up the delivery of her child, and her

36
00:03:21.749 --> 00:03:24.011
baby boy was born an hour later.

37
00:03:24.972 --> 00:03:30.392
Every woman should have a midwife when she is going to have a baby, but in Rome only

38
00:03:30.492 --> 00:03:31.993
wealthy women can hire one.

39
00:03:32.853 --> 00:03:37.754
When a woman first believes she is going to have a baby, she sends her slave to ask

40
00:03:37.814 --> 00:03:38.494
me to visit.

41
00:03:39.655 --> 00:03:44.836
Then I go to the woman's home to examine her body for signs that she will be a

42
00:03:44.896 --> 00:03:52.638
mother. I ask the woman many questions, and her answers help me determine when natal day—the day of

43
00:03:52.718 --> 00:03:53.618
birth—will be.

44
00:03:54.739 --> 00:03:59.060
Usually it takes about nine months for a baby to develop inside a woman.

45
00:03:59.872 --> 00:04:01.393
But every woman is different.

46
00:04:02.333 --> 00:04:06.635
Sometimes natal day comes a bit early and sometimes it is late.

47
00:04:07.636 --> 00:04:11.197
Even a midwife cannot know the exact day the baby will come.

48
00:04:12.138 --> 00:04:16.780
Most of the time, childbirth begins when the mother starts feeling labor spasms.

49
00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:22.182
Then a slave is sent to me, and I go quickly to the mother's home with two or

50
00:04:22.222 --> 00:04:23.043
three assistants.

51
00:04:23.863 --> 00:04:25.064
My daughter is one of them.

52
00:04:25.872 --> 00:04:31.774
Upon arrival we are taken into a room where the mother is lying in bed, usually in great

53
00:04:31.954 --> 00:04:39.057
pain. We bring soft strips of cloth, a pillow, herbs, and a special birthing chair.

54
00:04:39.797 --> 00:04:44.158
It is easier for mothers to give birth if they are sitting, rather than lying down.

55
00:04:44.839 --> 00:04:48.140
First we warm olive oil and water in pots.

56
00:04:49.064 --> 00:04:55.526
My assistants soak the soft cloths in water and then fold them against the woman's sides as she

57
00:04:55.586 --> 00:04:56.306
lies in bed.

58
00:04:57.067 --> 00:05:01.208
I massage the mother's belly and hips with warm olive oil too.

59
00:05:02.268 --> 00:05:04.109
The warmth eases the pain.

60
00:05:04.889 --> 00:05:09.010
Childbirth may take a few hours or last as long as a few days.

61
00:05:09.931 --> 00:05:13.572
But midwives always stay until the baby arrives.

62
00:05:14.324 --> 00:05:20.328
When the baby is ready to be born, my assistants and I carefully move the mother to the

63
00:05:20.368 --> 00:05:21.228
birthing chair.

64
00:05:22.069 --> 00:05:28.152
This chair has a wooden back and armrests that the mother can hold on to during the delivery.

65
00:05:28.993 --> 00:05:34.195
The seat is carved in the shape of a crescent moon so I can easily catch the baby

66
00:05:34.236 --> 00:05:35.036
when it comes out.

67
00:05:35.936 --> 00:05:41.760
My assistants hold the mother's shoulders and arms, and I bend down between the mother's legs.

68
00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:47.784
When I see the head of the baby coming out, I quickly wrap my hands in cloth or

69
00:05:47.864 --> 00:05:48.744
thin papyrus.

70
00:05:49.505 --> 00:05:53.828
I do this to make sure the baby does not slip out of my grasp.

71
00:05:54.588 --> 00:05:56.529
Finally the baby is born.

72
00:05:59.311 --> 00:06:03.114
Before giving the baby to the mother, I make sure it is healthy.

73
00:06:03.794 --> 00:06:08.597
I check the baby's arms and legs and count all the fingers and toes.

74
00:06:09.538 --> 00:06:12.180
A loud cry means the baby is strong.

75
00:06:13.052 --> 00:06:18.637
I also press a finger against the baby's skin to see if the baby is sensitive to touch.

76
00:06:19.577 --> 00:06:22.620
Then I cut the umbilical cord with a piece of pottery.

77
00:06:23.681 --> 00:06:29.565
After giving the baby a nice warm bath, I wrap it in a soft wool blanket, put it

78
00:06:29.625 --> 00:06:32.307
on a pillow, and give the baby to its mother.

79
00:06:33.368 --> 00:06:37.952
It is a Roman custom for the mother to then put the newborn on the floor.

80
00:06:38.848 --> 00:06:44.092
The father comes into the room and lifts the baby up to announce the new member of his

81
00:06:44.172 --> 00:06:48.535
family. I enjoy helping women give birth.

82
00:06:49.575 --> 00:06:56.140
There is no greater joy and satisfaction than seeing a new life enter this world.
